Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.55,0:00:08.78,Default,,0,0,0,,《Man of the Year》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.68,0:00:19.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Gliding through on my bike\N♪ 骑着自行车穿梭而过 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.70,0:00:24.10,Default,,0,0,0,,gliding through\N♪ 自在穿行 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.75,0:00:31.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Like new from my recent ego death\N♪ 仿佛从最近的自我消亡中重获新生 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.00,0:00:41.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Sirens sing overnight, violent, sweet music\N♪ 警笛声彻夜鸣响，是激烈又甜蜜的乐章 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.85,0:00:47.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You met me at a really strange time in my life\N♪ 你在我人生中一段异常奇妙的时光遇见了我 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.60,0:00:54.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Take my knife and I cut the cord\N♪ 拿起我的刀，斩断那羁绊 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.30,0:00:58.90,Default,,0,0,0,,My babe can't believe I've become someone else\N♪ 我的爱人不敢相信我已蜕变成另一个人 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.73,0:01:03.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone more like myself\N♪ 一个更贴近本真的自己 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.05,0:01:07.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's gon' love me like this?\N♪ 谁会这样爱我？ ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.33,0:01:12.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, who could give me lightness?\N♪ 哦，谁能给我轻盈的感觉？ ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.90,0:01:15.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Love me like this\N♪ 这样爱我 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.65,0:01:19.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I'm broken open\N♪ 如今我已敞开心扉 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.25,0:01:27.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh-uh-uh
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.68,0:01:32.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I go 'bout my day\N♪ 如今我过着自己的日子 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.75,0:01:35.83,Default,,0,0,0,,riding it like a wave\N♪ 像驾驭波浪般顺势而为 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.83,0:01:38.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Playing it any way I want\N♪ 随心所欲地生活 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.78,0:01:41.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Swish mouthwash, jerk off\N♪ 漱漱口，打打飞机 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.18,0:01:43.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh-uh-uh
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.65,0:01:45.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Days go by in a haze\N♪ 日子在迷雾中流逝 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.70,0:01:48.65,Default,,0,0,0,,stay up and sleep late\N♪ 熬夜到很晚才睡 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.43,0:01:55.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's gon' love me like this?\N♪ 谁会这样爱我？ ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.15,0:02:00.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, who could give me lightness?\N♪ 哦，谁能给我轻盈的感觉？ ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.23,0:02:02.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Way he flow down through me\N♪ 他流淌过我的方式 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.48,0:02:04.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Love me like this\N♪ 这样爱我 ♪
