Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.87,0:02:13.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's hear it for the man of the year\N♪ 让我们为年度人物欢呼 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.93,0:02:19.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Hear it for the man of the year\N♪ 为年度人物欢呼 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.85,0:02:30.18,Default,,0,0,0,,How I hope that I'm remembered, my\N♪ 我多么希望人们记得我，我的 ♪
